Subject: [PATCH 009/162] mmdevapi: Use a system thread for the audio driver
 main loop thread.

Adapted to the 11.0-era mmdevapi context; the fork's winepulse processes streams from the PulseAudio main loop, so only its entry points are converted.

(partially picked from commit a70f1eb8ee277dadc1a0a24592e20887469c136f)
